    "catalogue_description": "This is my first map it has custom guns from BO1,MW2,MW3, and various other games It has BO1 Perks + Electric Cherry The Map Requires T4M to run Bugs: To acquire another weapon slot (either start game or mule kick) you will have to buy a wallgun otherwise the mystery box will replace your gun even if you technically have another weapon slot. There are numerous coop bugs, I highly recommend only playing this map in single player. *please reply with any bugs you might find, they will not be fixed until a full remaster occurs*| Credit Weapons: Shippuden1592 The Stig (DamianoTBM) Killer Potato BaD BoY 17 Greazb435 WoLf_GoLd UGX Rourke Models & Perks: GymPie6 GU$TOMAN Pashan Font & HUD: DidUknowiPwn JR-Imagine Misc: UGXMods Team GAM3VIDZ NGcaudle",
